; ====================================================================================================
; ASHFALL HOMESTEAD — the player's holding (Phase 37E). Cell Center is (52, 0, 46), so every
; coordinate below is LOCAL and world = local + Center.
;
; ⚠️ IT REPLACES 37D's COTTAGE ENTIRELY. That was `bld_cottage.glb` — a sealed 4.8 m mesh you could
; not enter — beside a ROOFLESS pen of grey BoxMesh walls holding the stash. 37D's own comment said
; why: "an enterable interior needs a scene transition convention this repo does not have yet". That
; turned out not to be true. The megakit has walls with openings, floors and roofs, and the only
; thing missing was a composition with per-wall colliders instead of one solid box — which is now
; `compose_building.py --hollow`. There is no transition: you walk in through the door.
;
; ⚠️ EVERYTHING WITH A COLLIDER PARENTS TO `Nav`. Geometry outside the NavigationRegion3D is not
; carved into the bake (27A), and the failure is invisible until you watch something walk through a
; wall. The interactables (deed, stash, stands, bed) parent to the cell root exactly as they did in
; the town hub — they are Entities, not scenery, and their colliders are interact targets.
;
; ⚠️ THE PersistentIds ARE UNCHANGED FROM 37B/37D — `ember_crown.cottage_chest`,
; `ember_crown.cottage_trophy_a`, `ember_crown.cottage_trophy_b`. An inventory saves as
; `inventory:<PersistentId>`, so a player who had goods in the old chest still has them in this one.
; Renaming any of the three would silently empty a save's stash and read as item loss.
;
; The plot: the player arrives at the WEST gate (the Embermarket is the next cell west, abutting at
; local x = -26), walks the path east and turns north to the door. The house sits at local (0, -6)
; with its door on its +Z face, so the interior spans x -3..3, z -10..-2 and the doorway is at
; (-2, -2). The yard for 37C placement is the open ground SOUTH-EAST at (6, 8); the workshop is the
; three stations east of the house.
; ====================================================================================================

[node name="AshfallHomesteadCell" type="Node3D"]

[node name="Nav" type="NavigationRegion3D" parent="."]
navigation_mesh = SubResource("NavMesh_home")

[node name="NavBaker" type="Node" parent="Nav"]
script = ExtResource("navbaker_cleanup")

