; --- 37A: the deed post -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ⚠️ It stays OUTSIDE the house, on the path, where a non-owner can walk up to it — a deed nobody can
; reach is a deed nobody can buy, which is the mistake 37D fixed by moving it off the middle of the
; square. It is a waystone now rather than the grey BoxMesh it was: the post the player is asked for
; 600 gold at should not look like placeholder geometry.
;
; ⚠️ IT WAS A WAYSTONE FOR ONE RENDER AND THAT WAS WRONG. `prp_waystone` is 3 m of grey stone and it
; stood in the approach shot as a monolith blocking the front door — the model reads fine at 20 m on
; a road and dominates everything at 4 m on a garden path. A lectern is waist height, reads as
; something with a document on it, and lets the player see the house they are being sold.

[node name="CottageDeed" type="Node3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(0.766, 0, 0.6428, 0, 1, 0, -0.6428, 0, 0.766, -9.6, 0, -5.4)
script = ExtResource("1_entity")
DisplayName = "Deed Post"

[node name="Mesh" parent="CottageDeed" instance=ExtResource("8_deedstand")]

