; --- Ground cover, re-scattered for the 2026-08-28 layout-rebuild plot (this cell imports ONE grass model, 37_grass,
; --- not the nine-species set the other cells use, so tools/redress_cell.py has nothing to work with
; --- here). Tufts sit on the verges: clear of the cottage, the workshop row, the approach path and
; --- the 7 m build yard at local (0, 5), which must stay open ground for the placement system.

